              "text": "66",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bhonsui bhano bhaagaiguurë, mbaagaitegereeyë kumioyo geebho bharagamba iga, “Ömoona öno möntö öteemo kë arëbhe?” Kugira ichinguru chö Ömönene nchaarë harë we.",
          "type": "text",
